 body that students study in VR or in their own room.\n\n- Explore 2,400 parts: point at any bone, muscle, organ, vessel, nerve or gland to see its name and job, and hear a teacher explain how it works.\n- Organ Lab: large detailed models of the heart, eye, ear, brain, lungs, kidney, tooth and skin, with 61 guided steps: blood through the heart's chambers, light focusing in the eye, sound travelling through the ear and more.\n- Journeys: follow air from the nose to every cell, food from the mouth to energy and waste, and blood around the body, step by step.\n- Take apart: organs and bones float out of the body, labelled.\n- Put-back game: grab each organ or bone and return it to its place.\n- Teacher voice and text in English, Hindi and Hinglish.\n- Works offline after the first launch.\n\nFor schools: full access comes with a DUET STEM school subscription code. Without a code, a free 10-minute demo is available every day.", "short_description": "Step inside a see-through 3D human body: every bone, organ, vessel and nerve named and explained, with organs shown working, for school students in English, Hindi and Hinglish."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/body/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DUET Power", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ashutoshduet.github.io/duet-lms-media/body/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "hi"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "s